<title>UK: TMCC sets 400 mln Dkr bond due Dec 2002.</title>
<headline>TMCC sets 400 mln Dkr bond due Dec 2002.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BBL.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TOYOTA MOTOR CREDIT CORP</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON     5.625     MATURITY    27.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.10    PAY DATE   S06.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10-50     SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
